I've reported this as a bug to the devteam a couple of times, with no
response. What do y'all think?

If you approach the edge of a stinking cloud with astral vision, then a
portion of the cloud seems to disappear. Sometimes it can look just
like when the cloud shrinks as it's wearing off. But this is really
just your astral vision showing you what's there, since if you move to
one of the apparently safe squares you'll find the cloud is still
there.

I think it's a bug that astral vision can actually fail to show you
something that you would otherwise see.



